{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51930","headline":"洞阳峯 · 程太虚","name":"洞阳峯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南岷胜槩压诸方，东壁奇峯出洞阳。\n丈五月轮才晃曜，大千世界便辉光。\n扶开华岳烟云渺，显得蓬莱日月长。\n世道废兴原有数，浮沉聚散亦何伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"程太虚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51930.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51930","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}